From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:19:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] minimal home screen: hotseat only, no second page

One screen: the hotseat as that grid ships it, and the clock. The Google search widget, the
Google folder, the Play shortcut and the whole second screen are gone.

Rebuilt against lineage-24.0's Launcher3 rather than ported: the launcher was renamed from
Trebuchet, and its stock layouts gained entries the 23.2 patch never saw (a Twelve now-playing
widget, a Settings shortcut), so a context diff could not have applied. Each grid keeps its own
hotseat -- they differ per size -- and the clock spans the grid's width.
---
